 JOB       SCHEDULE / TRIGGER                 REQUIREMENTS            SLA
 --------  ---------------------------------  ----------------------  -----
 CFKYC01   SUN 06:00 (MBKWKLY)                 CIFMAST CLOSED IN       07:00
           HELD - MANUAL RELEASE               CICSPRD1
           (SEE NOTE 3)
 CFMRG01   SAT 20:00 (MBKWKLY)                 ACCTMST, CIFMAST,       23:00
           HELD - MANUAL RELEASE               LOANMST CLOSED IN
           (SEE NOTE 6)                        CICSPRD1
 DDDRM01   FIRST SAT OF MONTH (MBKMTH)         PSEOD01                 03:30
           JOB TRIGGER PSEOD01
 CFDUP01   FIRST SAT OF MONTH (MBKMTH)         MBKONLUP                09:00
           JOB TRIGGER MBKONLUP
 CFSEG01   FIRST SAT OF MONTH (MBKMTH)         MBKONLDN                02:00
           JOB TRIGGER MBKONLDN
 MIEXT01   FIRST BUSINESS DAY (MBKMTH)         PSEOD01,                04:00
           JOB TRIGGER PSEOD01                 CFSEG01 (IF SCHED)
 CHGTAR01  FIRST BUSINESS DAY (MBKMTH)         PSEOD01, INCAP01,       04:00
           JOB TRIGGER CGCHG01                 CGCHG01
 PSARC01   FIRST SUN AFTER MONTH END 02:00     NOT WHILE PSEOD01 OR    06:00
           (MBKMTH) - SEE BELOW                IBFEED02 IS ACTIVE

 DDDRM01 RUNS INSIDE THAT NIGHT'S MBKEOD WINDOW (IT UPDATES ACCTMAST
 AND READS THE DATE CARD) - MBKDTROL WAITS FOR IT. CFDUP01 READS
 CIFMAST SHARED AND RUNS AFTER THE ONLINE DAY HAS RESTARTED.
 CFSEG01 ALSO RUNS INSIDE THAT NIGHT'S MBKEOD WINDOW: IT UPDATES
 CIFMAST (DISP=OLD), SO IT IS HELD ON MBKONLDN, AND IT READS THE DATE
 CARD, SO BCPEXT01 WAITS FOR IT. SEGMENT CHANGES GO TO CRM (NODE
 CRMP01). MIEXT01 WAITS FOR IT WHEN BOTH RUN THE SAME NIGHT.
 MIEXT01 AND CHGTAR01 ALSO RUN INSIDE THAT NIGHT'S MBKEOD WINDOW (THEY
 READ THE DATE CARD) - BCPEXT01, AND SO MBKDTROL, WAIT FOR THEM.
 CHGTAR01 WAITS FOR CGCHG01 SO THE MONTH'S APPLIED CHARGES (CG030
 CGAPL010) AND INCAP01'S INTEREST ARE IN THE SUMMARY. CFMRG01 MERGES
 CUSTOMERS APPROVED FROM THE CFDUP01 CANDIDATE LIST (FOUR-EYES).
 PSARC01 DELETES FROM MBK.TXNHIST AND IS MUTUALLY EXCLUSIVE WITH
 PSEOD01 (WRITES TXNHIST) AND IBFEED02 (READS IT) - CA-7 NEGATIVE
 DEPENDENCIES, WHICHEVER STARTS FIRST RUNS. MBKDTROL DOES NOT WAIT FOR
 IT, BUT IF IT STARTS AFTER SATURDAY NIGHT'S PSEOD01 THEN IBFEED02
 (AND SO BCPEXT01 AND MBKDTROL) WAIT UNTIL IT ENDS - THE MBKEOD SLAS
 ARE AT RISK THAT NIGHT. MAXROWS (005000000) LIMITS THE RUN LENGTH: IT
 STOPS CLEANLY WITH RC 4 AND THE REST IS PURGED NEXT MONTH.
